comment = "Hardware telemetry with OpenTelemetry output"

desc = <<EOD
hwstat collects CPU power consumption (Intel RAPL or AMD Zen package energy), CPU
temperatures, frequencies, C-state usage, ACPI thermal zones,
and GPU state, and ships the results as text, JSONL, or OTLP/HTTP
metrics to an OpenTelemetry collector.  The sysctl-based sensors are
architecture-independent; energy data requires a supported Intel or AMD CPU and
read access to cpuctl(4).
EOD
